+	help
+	  This driver supports the 26 MHz clock buffers of the MediaTek
+	  MT6358 and MT6366 PMICs, which supply reference clocks to
+	  peripherals such as NFC controllers and connectivity chips.
+
+	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the
+	  module will be called clk-mt6358.
